@startuml card-api-endpoints
title card.api — PurchaseController routes

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package card.api {
  class PurchaseController

  package dto {
    class CreatePurchaseRequest
    class PurchaseTrailResponse
    class PurchaseDetailResponse
  }
}

PurchaseController --> CreatePurchaseRequest : "POST /api/purchases\nbody"
PurchaseController --> PurchaseTrailResponse : "POST /api/purchases\nreturns"
PurchaseController --> PurchaseDetailResponse : "GET /api/purchases/{purchaseId}\nreturns"

note right of PurchaseController
  Idempotency-Key header on POST
  is optional. Declines:
  unknown card → 404
  insufficient available → 422
end note

@enduml
